I've composed the list as one surface. The catalog has no container component, so a single-column `columns` block holds the heading, the status filter and the eight-item list.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9.1",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "status_list",
      "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-data-display.json"
    }
  },
  {
    "version": "v0.9.1",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "status_list",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "columns",
          "cols": 1,
          "gap": "1rem",
          "align": "top",
          "items": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "component": "heading",
                  "id": "title",
                  "text": "Work Items"
                },
                {
                  "component": "segmented_control",
                  "id": "status_filter",
                  "name": "status_filter",
                  "selected_value": "all",
                  "options": [
                    { "label": "All", "value": "all" },
                    { "label": "Active", "value": "active" },
                    { "label": "Pending", "value": "pending" },
                    { "label": "Blocked", "value": "blocked" },
                    { "label": "Done", "value": "done" }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "component": "entity_list",
                  "id": "items_list",
                  "items": [
                    { "name": "Migrate billing database", "subtitle": "Cutover scheduled for Friday night", "icon": "🗄️", "status": "Active" },
                    { "name": "Redesign onboarding flow", "subtitle": "Waiting on final copy from marketing", "icon": "🎨", "status": "Pending" },
                    { "name": "Upgrade payment SDK", "subtitle": "Blocked by vendor certification review", "icon": "💳", "status": "Blocked" },
                    { "name": "Publish API v2 docs", "subtitle": "Released and announced to partners", "icon": "📘", "status": "Done" },
                    { "name": "Fix mobile login timeout", "subtitle": "Patch in QA on iOS and Android", "icon": "📱", "status": "Active" },
                    { "name": "Security audit follow-ups", "subtitle": "Three findings awaiting owner assignment", "icon": "🔒", "status": "Pending" },
                    { "name": "Provision EU data region", "subtitle": "Blocked on legal approval of data terms", "icon": "🌍", "status": "Blocked" },
                    { "name": "Retire legacy cron jobs", "subtitle": "All jobs migrated and decommissioned", "icon": "⏱️", "status": "Done" }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
</a2ui-json>

The segmented control (All, Active, Pending, Blocked, Done) is the status filter and starts on "All". The catalog has no data-binding or action wiring between components, so the client has to apply the selection to the list.
